{"change_summary":"Patched the shrimp molt runtime so disabling GH minimums no longer triggers a false `critical_molt_gh_ratio` hard fail, and replaced the hidden `0.25` molt-cadence temperature clamp with the named `temp_condition_min_factor` floor plus a defensive `0.01` denominator guard. I strengthened regressions to assert successful molts when all mineral minimums are disabled, updated cold-path tests to use the named cadence floor, added a dedicated cadence-floor regression, and added runtime validation coverage that `temp_condition_min_factor = 0.0` remains valid; the preset-layer zero-floor validation fix was already present on the branch and was revalidated in this pass.","outstanding_risks":[],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the pending amendments and confirmed the two runtime issues still reproduced in `molt_cycle`, while the preset-layer `temp_condition_min_factor = 0.0` validation fix was already present and needed only revalidation.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` to skip the critical-GH deficit override when `gh_min_d` is disabled and to drive molt cadence from the named `temp_condition_min_factor` floor instead of the hidden `0.25` clamp.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Extended `molt_mineral_budget.rs`, `events.rs`, and `validation.rs` so the zero-minimum mineral case asserts `last_molt_success`, cold-path readiness uses the named cadence floor, cadence-floor behavior is explicitly regression-tested, and runtime validation locks in `temp_condition_min_factor = 0.0` acceptance.","order":3,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran formatting plus focused and broad validation across `tank_core`, `tank_data`, and `tank_scenarios` to verify the runtime fixes and the already-present preset validation contract end to end.","order":4,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["cargo fmt --all","cargo test -p tank_core --test molt_mineral_budget -- --nocapture","cargo test -p tank_core --test events -- --nocapture","cargo test -p tank_core --test validation -- --nocapture","cargo test -p tank_data -- --nocapture","cargo test -p tank_scenarios -- --nocapture","cargo test -p tank_core -- --nocapture"]}